00:55:44,675 --> 00:55:47,511
This is the first time I've seen
something make you uncomfortable.

722
00:55:53,476 --> 00:55:55,853
I need you with me, not against me.

723
00:56:01,901 --> 00:56:03,611
You help me stay sane,

724
00:56:03,694 --> 00:56:06,113
but you don't have the luxury
of challenging me.

725
00:56:06,906 --> 00:56:08,032
Bon appétit.

726
00:56:20,544 --> 00:56:21,754
Cheers.

727
00:57:55,181 --> 00:57:56,974
Not long until the next round.

728
00:57:58,142 --> 00:58:00,102
Do you think he'll be able to run?

729
00:58:01,729 --> 00:58:04,064
I'm a doctor, not a seer.

730
00:58:05,065 --> 00:58:09,069
But these are embryonic stem cells.
They regenerate tissue very quickly.

731
00:58:11,697 --> 00:58:13,782
No wonder it costs a fortune.

732
00:58:13,866 --> 00:58:15,784
How are we going to pay for this?

733
00:58:16,994 --> 00:58:18,662
Your player already did.

734
00:58:20,247 --> 00:58:23,500
Now just rest,
and take this every six hours.

735
00:58:24,960 --> 00:58:26,086
Excuse me.

736
00:58:26,170 --> 00:58:27,588
Thanks, Doctor.

737
00:58:35,221 --> 00:58:36,222
Recfi.

738
00:58:36,972 --> 00:58:39,892
-What about it?
-I'm not taking that shit.

739
00:58:42,478 --> 00:58:43,520
Listen, Mano.

740
00:58:45,522 --> 00:58:48,025
Your pride won't heal you.

741
00:58:48,859 --> 00:58:52,154
That drug is from the lab on Hell's Coast.

742
00:58:52,780 --> 00:58:53,822
So what?

743
00:58:54,698 --> 00:58:56,533
Want to send your sister there,

744
00:58:57,868 --> 00:58:59,286
or would you rather run?

745
00:59:00,371 --> 00:59:05,459
All those years on the track,
I've never seen a player help an animal.

746
00:59:09,088 --> 00:59:12,383
And I ran so many years.

747
00:59:13,759 --> 00:59:17,805
-I learned a lot on the track and I can--
-I just need to rest.

748
00:59:32,695 --> 00:59:34,780
Dalva!

749
00:59:34,863 --> 00:59:36,240
What the fuck have you done?

750
01:00:00,055 --> 01:00:01,724
Is this how you greet your friends?

751
01:00:02,599 --> 01:00:04,351
Not going to stand up to speak to me?

752
01:00:06,353 --> 01:00:07,354
Damn.

753
01:00:10,899 --> 01:00:14,194
You are as ugly as ever.

754
01:00:24,621 --> 01:00:28,334
How could she pull shit like that
knowing the risk she was running?

755
01:00:29,168 --> 01:00:31,587
She was desperate.
She didn't think Mano would run again.

756
01:00:32,087 --> 01:00:35,466
This place looks like a fucking hospital.
When did she do it?

757
01:00:36,300 --> 01:00:38,427
Two hours ago.

758
01:00:38,927 --> 01:00:40,637
That's fine, then.

759
01:00:49,188 --> 01:00:51,106
Did your dad tell you we ran together?

760
01:00:52,483 --> 01:00:56,362
-He was good, the bastard.
-She's dying.

761
01:00:57,363 --> 01:01:00,282
But fate is a funny thing.

762
01:01:00,366 --> 01:01:02,368
He ended up in that wheelchair,

763
01:01:02,451 --> 01:01:07,164
and I, a son of a bitch,
was privileged enough to succeed.

764
01:01:09,500 --> 01:01:11,377
And there are people who believe in God.

765
01:01:11,460 --> 01:01:12,878
Do you believe in God, Dalva?

766
01:01:12,961 --> 01:01:15,506
-Are you just going to fuck around?
-Relax.

767
01:01:17,383 --> 01:01:18,217
Relax.

768
01:01:22,638 --> 01:01:23,889
She's just paralyzed.

769
01:01:25,766 --> 01:01:27,684
There's still an hour to save her.

770
01:01:29,061 --> 01:01:30,562
If she takes the antidote.

771
01:01:33,440 --> 01:01:34,483
If I want her to.

772
01:01:50,040 --> 01:01:51,041
Abu.

773
01:01:57,965 --> 01:01:59,007
Save my daughter.

774
01:02:01,093 --> 01:02:02,052
Please.

775
01:02:06,723 --> 01:02:10,144
Because of my history
with your dad and this family,

776
01:02:10,227 --> 01:02:12,396
I'm going to do something I never do.

777
01:02:14,148 --> 01:02:15,941
Spare someone who tried to screw me over.

778
01:02:19,528 --> 01:02:20,821
Take the girl.

779
01:02:26,702 --> 01:02:28,704
Be careful, please.

780
01:02:28,787 --> 01:02:31,123
Didn't you hear the boss?

781
01:02:41,633 --> 01:02:43,635
She stays with me
till the end of the season.

782
01:02:43,719 --> 01:02:47,264
And be thankful.
I should have sent her to Hell's Coast.

783
01:02:48,599 --> 01:02:49,600
She deserves it.

784
01:02:51,894 --> 01:02:53,270
Make the boy take those.

785
01:03:07,910 --> 01:03:09,244
Take this.

786
01:03:10,120 --> 01:03:11,830
-Take it all.
-No, thanks.

787
01:03:18,170 --> 01:03:21,048
-I don't think I can.
-Of course you can, come on.

788
01:03:21,757 --> 01:03:24,134
<i>There are still a few days to go.</i>
<i>You are doing well.</i>

789
01:03:27,221 --> 01:03:30,724
It might not seem like it,
but the game is a partnership.

790
01:03:31,558 --> 01:03:33,519
Animals can't survive without players.

791
01:03:37,105 --> 01:03:39,233
-Hey, give me that.
-But I'm better.

792
01:03:39,316 --> 01:03:43,362
You are not 100%. Here. Juice made by Dad.

793
01:03:45,864 --> 01:03:48,283
Animals can't make it without players.
You must be a unit.

794
01:03:48,367 --> 01:03:51,203
You've got the legs, the muscles.
They are the eyes.

795
01:03:51,286 --> 01:03:52,329
Got it.

796
01:03:53,247 --> 01:03:56,959
<i>It's not enough knowing how to run</i>
<i>and fight, but then losing your head.</i>

797
01:03:58,835 --> 01:04:01,880
They will want to annoy you,
distract you, make you waste time.

798
01:04:02,464 --> 01:04:05,175
<i>That's why you think before you act.</i>

799
01:04:05,259 --> 01:04:07,010
And another thing. Bull.

800
01:04:07,678 --> 01:04:09,846
Bull is strong, but he's predictable.

801
01:04:11,098 --> 01:04:13,809
<i>He's going to want to do the same thing</i>
<i>he did to you last time.</i>

802
01:04:13,892 --> 01:04:15,185
What will it be?

803
01:04:15,269 --> 01:04:18,272
Move over a little and give him a push.

804
01:04:18,355 --> 01:04:20,274
<i>Use his strength to take him down.</i>

805
01:04:28,657 --> 01:04:29,700
Put it on Bear.

806
01:04:34,997 --> 01:04:36,373
Damn.

807
01:04:36,456 --> 01:04:39,334
-A bit rusty?
-I got carried away.

808
01:04:42,087 --> 01:04:44,881
Don't make excuses. You've been
losing to me since we were kids.

809
01:04:48,093 --> 01:04:49,428
It looks pretty from here.

810
01:04:50,012 --> 01:04:51,305
Hell's Coast.

811
01:04:52,514 --> 01:04:54,850
They say there are more than 1000 lost.

812
01:04:54,933 --> 01:04:58,020
And most of them young, like Dalva.

813
01:04:59,229 --> 01:05:00,772
This shit has to end.

814
01:05:01,690 --> 01:05:03,525
It's no use
if only a handful are against it.

815
01:05:04,234 --> 01:05:07,779
People want to dream of a different life,
like Dalva.

816
01:05:08,697 --> 01:05:11,325
No one cares if we lose someone.

817
01:05:14,161 --> 01:05:15,912
I admire you, you know?

818
01:05:16,747 --> 01:05:18,123
You took them on.

819
01:05:19,166 --> 01:05:21,627
But do you really think
you can take down the game?

820
01:05:27,758 --> 01:05:30,052
<i>Wear the mask your sister made for you.</i>

821
01:05:33,221 --> 01:05:34,222
<i>Run for her.</i>

822
01:05:50,489 --> 01:05:52,783
-Stop!
-Gonna hunt me, huh?

823
01:05:52,866 --> 01:05:54,117
Fucking Hunter.

824
01:05:54,201 --> 01:05:55,619
That's enough, damn it!

825
01:05:58,830 --> 01:06:01,375
-That Hunter shouldn't be here!
-And?

826
01:06:04,169 --> 01:06:06,171
Out there, anyone can do what they like.

827
01:06:07,130 --> 01:06:09,966
Kill their mom, put her in the freezer,
whatever. But here…

828
01:06:13,095 --> 01:06:15,889
Here, I'm the one who decides
what can and can't be done.

829
01:06:15,972 --> 01:06:17,599
I want that animal on the track.

830
01:06:17,683 --> 01:06:20,519
If he falls off it, that's it.

831
01:06:22,813 --> 01:06:24,773
Abu, how's Dalva?

832
01:06:24,856 --> 01:06:28,110
Just run. You run.
If you come through alive, we will talk.

833
01:06:28,193 --> 01:06:30,153
Careful. Mind your own business.

834
01:06:36,743 --> 01:06:38,245
<i>Okay, gang.</i>

835
01:06:38,328 --> 01:06:40,747
<i>Heat two is about to begin.</i>

836
01:06:40,831 --> 01:06:42,207
<i>It's the talk of the town.</i>

837
01:06:42,290 --> 01:06:45,168
If you are smart,
you will bet on these beasts.

838
01:06:45,252 --> 01:06:47,754
SECOND RACE
SEASON 147

839
01:06:47,838 --> 01:06:51,466
<i>Hope is a shot that goes down hard</i>
<i>and fires up your heart.</i>

840
01:06:52,092 --> 01:06:56,430
<i>This is the longest heat.</i>
<i>9 kilometers to the finish line.</i>

841
01:06:56,513 --> 01:06:59,558
<i>Take a deep breath. You will need it.</i>

842
01:06:59,641 --> 01:07:02,602
<i>There are 15 left on the track</i>
<i>to race for the jackpot,</i>

843
01:07:02,686 --> 01:07:05,439
<i>but only ten will get into the next heat.</i>

844
01:07:05,522 --> 01:07:08,400
<i>Five will go home,</i>
<i>crying over their defeat.</i>

845
01:07:08,483 --> 01:07:09,985
<i>Pig is highly rated,</i>

846
01:07:10,068 --> 01:07:13,488
<i>Horse slayed during the last race,</i>

847
01:07:13,572 --> 01:07:15,991
<i>Eagle is paying well this time,</i>

848
01:07:16,074 --> 01:07:19,453
<i>but Bull, once again, is the favorite.</i>

849
01:07:19,536 --> 01:07:25,417
<i>And Cat, after qualifying the way he did,</i>
<i>is back.</i>

850
01:07:25,500 --> 01:07:28,503
<i>He hasn't got nine lives, he's got 300.</i>

851
01:07:28,587 --> 01:07:31,631
<i>That being said, if I were him,</i>
<i>I would stay away from Bull.</i>

852
01:07:31,715 --> 01:07:32,716
<i>Good luck, Cat.</i>

853
01:07:32,799 --> 01:07:34,468
I don't believe in luck.

854
01:07:35,218 --> 01:07:37,012
Believe in me. You will need to.

855
01:07:39,139 --> 01:07:40,056
I'm ready.

856
01:07:47,606 --> 01:07:49,107
<i>Ladies and gentlemen,</i>

857
01:07:50,066 --> 01:07:51,067
and now it's…

858
01:07:51,693 --> 01:07:55,906
…time to unleash the beasts!

859
01:07:59,576 --> 01:08:00,786
Go.

860
01:08:01,369 --> 01:08:03,413
<i>And they are off!</i>

861
01:08:10,003 --> 01:08:13,048
<i>Bull takes off in front of Pig.</i>

862
01:08:13,924 --> 01:08:16,134
Go, take that path. Keep going.

863
01:08:16,843 --> 01:08:17,844
<i>That's it.</i>

864
01:08:19,429 --> 01:08:21,139
<i>Horse and Eagle are good.</i>

865
01:08:21,223 --> 01:08:23,308
<i>They are pulling out in front.</i>

866
01:08:26,061 --> 01:08:27,687
-Fuck!
-Wait.

867
01:08:27,771 --> 01:08:29,940
-I can't see you.
-Is it this way?

868
01:08:31,274 --> 01:08:34,528
All I see are trees. I can't see.
Wait, I can't see you.

869
01:08:35,779 --> 01:08:39,616
Today this Cat is more lost
than a needle in a haystack.

870
01:08:39,699 --> 01:08:41,952
Now… right.

871
01:08:43,328 --> 01:08:45,038
<i>Keep heading down. It will be fine.</i>

872
01:08:45,914 --> 01:08:47,207
<i>That's it. Great.</i>

873
01:08:51,169 --> 01:08:53,421
There's a slope 50 meters ahead.

874
01:08:54,923 --> 01:08:56,091
Take Eagle out.

875
01:09:00,762 --> 01:09:04,224
<i>Bear and Bull, </i>the brothers,
<i>running together.</i>

876
01:09:04,307 --> 01:09:05,976
<i>One attacks, the other finishes the job.</i>

877
01:09:06,059 --> 01:09:07,435
Get away from Bear.

878
01:09:07,519 --> 01:09:11,606
<i>That's how they play.</i>
<i>The animals they choose are screwed.</i>

879
01:09:14,025 --> 01:09:15,861
<i>Everyone's in a rush,</i>

880
01:09:15,944 --> 01:09:20,073
<i>and on the verge of leaving the jungle</i>
<i>and reaching the cement of the city.</i>

881
01:09:20,156 --> 01:09:22,826
<i>Desperation, urgency.</i>

882
01:09:22,909 --> 01:09:25,537
<i>This is about survival, my friends.</i>

883
01:09:25,620 --> 01:09:27,455
You are going to see a wall. Jump over.

884
01:09:27,539 --> 01:09:30,750
<i>Rabbit and Tigress are neck and neck,</i>
<i>followed by Bear.</i>

885
01:09:30,834 --> 01:09:34,588
<i>There he is!</i>
<i>Cat jumps the wall and gains ground.</i>

886
01:09:34,671 --> 01:09:36,756
Fuck, you've landed me
right in Bear's path.

887
01:09:37,424 --> 01:09:38,592
Now Bear is looking at Cat.

888
01:09:40,635 --> 01:09:41,636
Don't get into a fight.

889
01:09:47,934 --> 01:09:49,269
Are you playing against me?

890
01:09:49,352 --> 01:09:50,937
Keep going straight.

891
01:09:51,021 --> 01:09:52,689
No, I'm getting away.

892
01:09:53,440 --> 01:09:54,524
<i>Trust me.</i>

893
01:09:54,608 --> 01:09:57,027
<i>You are headed</i>
<i>for an area of shipping containers.</i>

894
01:09:58,111 --> 01:09:59,779
Make the most of the <i>playground.</i>

895
01:10:10,707 --> 01:10:13,668
<i>The animals enter the old port area.</i>

896
01:10:14,502 --> 01:10:17,797
<i>Cat never stops. He's still on the hunt.</i>

897
01:10:18,423 --> 01:10:19,633
Leave Rat. Keep going.

898
01:10:23,511 --> 01:10:27,307
<i>There's no time to waste in here.</i>
<i>It's a mess.</i>

899
01:10:27,390 --> 01:10:31,019
Players that take their eye off the ball
will see their animals fall.

900
01:10:34,898 --> 01:10:36,316
Get up on the container.

901
01:10:39,027 --> 01:10:40,070
Jump.

902
01:10:40,153 --> 01:10:42,030
<i>Cat is looking for an exit.</i>

903
01:10:42,113 --> 01:10:44,616
<i>The flock is flying low.</i>

904
01:10:45,200 --> 01:10:47,160
<i>Eagle, Bull, Goat, Bear.</i>

905
01:10:47,243 --> 01:10:49,371
<i>Here we can't know who's in the lead.</i>

906
01:10:49,454 --> 01:10:52,791
<i>Everyone's looking for the exit.</i>

907
01:10:53,541 --> 01:10:55,085
Go, go, that's it.

908
01:10:55,168 --> 01:10:57,295
<i>This sure is confusing stuff.</i>

909
01:10:59,381 --> 01:11:01,174
-Watch out for Lion!
<i>-Look at Lion!</i>

910
01:11:01,257 --> 01:11:05,011
<i>Showing us yet again, he might be small,</i>
<i>but he's not messing around.</i>

911
01:11:05,095 --> 01:11:09,474
<i>He came in third in his first race,</i>
<i>and he's out for blood now.</i>

912
01:11:10,141 --> 01:11:11,601
<i>Pig's right there.</i>

913
01:11:15,730 --> 01:11:17,107
Fuck, tell me sooner.

914
01:11:19,192 --> 01:11:21,069
<i>Stop complaining. Concentrate.</i>

915
01:11:21,987 --> 01:11:23,530
<i>They are in the game. Get with it.</i>

916
01:11:25,323 --> 01:11:27,200
Keep going and wait for my signal.

917
01:11:32,664 --> 01:11:35,959
Go, go, go. Stop.

918
01:11:49,264 --> 01:11:51,933
Great! Do what I say, we get it right.

919
01:11:52,017 --> 01:11:53,476
First time for everything.

920
01:11:53,560 --> 01:11:55,520
<i>Cat surprises us again.</i>

921
01:11:55,603 --> 01:11:57,731
<i>He's showing his claws.</i>

922
01:11:57,814 --> 01:12:00,775
Put Pig and Bear in the crib
and rocked them to sleep.

923
01:12:04,279 --> 01:12:05,488
<i>Get Lion.</i>

924
01:12:05,572 --> 01:12:07,907
Careful, he's small but strong.

925
01:12:09,659 --> 01:12:11,119
I told you.

926
01:12:13,121 --> 01:12:14,330
<i>Throw him against the wall.</i>

927
01:12:22,255 --> 01:12:23,757
Break him in half.

928
01:12:28,261 --> 01:12:30,972
<i>I have to say,</i>
<i>that's not good for little Lion.</i>

929
01:12:31,056 --> 01:12:33,933
<i>He will fall behind,</i>
<i>if he manages to get up.</i>

930
01:12:34,768 --> 01:12:39,189
<i>And they have finally found the exit</i>
<i>into the Dry Sea.</i>

931
01:12:39,272 --> 01:12:41,608
Now to cross the Dry Sea. You have to fly.

932
01:12:41,691 --> 01:12:42,901
<i>The herd are moving forwards.</i>

933
01:12:42,984 --> 01:12:46,071
They are finally out of the rat's nest
and making progress.

934
01:12:47,781 --> 01:12:51,493
<i>The Dry Sea is a tricky track,</i>
<i>hard going and hard breathing.</i>

935
01:12:53,787 --> 01:12:57,123
<i>There are four more kilometers</i>
<i>to the finish line,</i>

936
01:12:57,207 --> 01:12:59,459
<i>circling the Perimeter's wall.</i>

937
01:13:04,214 --> 01:13:07,675
You are in the city.
Jump the truck and keep going straight.

938
01:13:08,760 --> 01:13:09,886
<i>Bull has taken off,</i>

939
01:13:09,969 --> 01:13:12,847
<i>but Bear is still trying to take Cat down.</i>

940
01:13:13,765 --> 01:13:15,600
<i>Don't let him drag you into a fight.</i>

941
01:13:17,477 --> 01:13:18,895
<i>You are last and you are hurt.</i>

942
01:13:19,896 --> 01:13:22,232
<i>You don't stand a chance.</i>

943
01:13:22,315 --> 01:13:24,776
<i>-You have to go through the Perimeter.</i>
-Not the Perimeter.

944
01:13:25,568 --> 01:13:27,153
<i>If Cat did it, you can too.</i>

945
01:13:29,823 --> 01:13:32,408
<i>There goes Lion, without much of a chance.</i>

946
01:13:32,492 --> 01:13:35,829
<i>He's desperate.</i>
<i>It's his brother who is collateral.</i>

947
01:13:35,912 --> 01:13:38,123
<i>He's headed for the Perimeter.</i>

948
01:13:38,206 --> 01:13:40,583
<i>It's crazy, but it's his only chance.</i>

949
01:13:42,001 --> 01:13:44,838
<i>And it's when animals are desperate</i>
<i>that they screw up.</i>

950
01:13:46,256 --> 01:13:47,549
Don't let him.

951
01:13:47,632 --> 01:13:50,885
<i>-Bear is still on Cat's tail.</i>
-Careful of Pig.

952
01:13:51,886 --> 01:13:52,929
Down!

953
01:13:53,471 --> 01:13:55,181
-Fuck!
-Damn!

954
01:13:55,807 --> 01:13:57,433
<i>What a move!</i>

955
01:13:57,517 --> 01:13:59,936
He tied those suckers in a knot.

956
01:14:00,019 --> 01:14:03,940
Cat's off now.
No one can hold that animal down.

957
01:14:26,337 --> 01:14:27,547
Seriously, bro. Come here!

958
01:14:27,630 --> 01:14:29,424
Get him!

959
01:14:36,890 --> 01:14:40,393
And the leading group is going to
turn the corner and sprint for the finish.

960
01:14:42,312 --> 01:14:45,356
You are ahead. Just keep running.

961
01:14:45,440 --> 01:14:46,399
Go, go.

962
01:14:46,900 --> 01:14:49,611
<i>And they are all neck and neck</i>
<i>on this homestretch.</i>

963
01:14:49,694 --> 01:14:52,822
<i>Rabbit was going to take second,</i>
<i>but she falls.</i>

964
01:14:52,906 --> 01:14:55,867
<i>And Cat is overtaking</i>
<i>like there's no tomorrow,</i>

965
01:14:55,950 --> 01:14:58,494
<i>heading for Bull in first.</i>

966
01:14:59,287 --> 01:15:01,956
<i>The finish line is about fists and dust.</i>

967
01:15:02,040 --> 01:15:04,083
Is Cat going to take this one, guys?

968
01:15:04,834 --> 01:15:06,294
<i>Don't waste time fighting.</i>

969
01:15:06,377 --> 01:15:08,588
<i>It isn't the time for revenge.</i>
<i>It's time to win.</i>

970
01:15:12,467 --> 01:15:14,928
<i>Cat and Bull try to take each other down.</i>

971
01:15:15,803 --> 01:15:17,847
-Stop fighting.
-Go on.

972
01:15:20,642 --> 01:15:23,228
<i>And Bull pushes Cat off the track!</i>

973
01:15:27,398 --> 01:15:28,233
Go, go!

974
01:15:36,783 --> 01:15:39,244
<i>Fourth? You should have been first.</i>

975
01:15:39,327 --> 01:15:41,537
<i>I'm through. Don't complain.</i>

976
01:15:42,997 --> 01:15:46,668
They were messing around
when it counted the most.

977
01:15:46,751 --> 01:15:49,420
<i>And the brothers take first and second.</i>

978
01:15:49,504 --> 01:15:50,838
<i>Goat in third.</i>

979
01:15:50,922 --> 01:15:53,633
<i>Cat, who was leading, takes fourth.</i>

980
01:15:53,716 --> 01:15:54,842
<i>Tigress fifth.</i>

981
01:15:54,926 --> 01:15:58,721
<i>And those were the top five,</i>
<i>who will take a bit of money home.</i>

982
01:15:58,805 --> 01:16:02,350
<i>The rest are still on the track,</i>
<i>sweating it out to qualify.</i>

983
01:16:02,433 --> 01:16:06,187
<i>Ten go onto the semifinal, to fight it out</i>
<i>for five spots in the final.</i>

984
01:16:06,271 --> 01:16:08,773
Abu.

985
01:16:09,774 --> 01:16:10,608
How's Dalva?

986
01:16:11,442 --> 01:16:12,443
Alive.

987
01:16:13,194 --> 01:16:14,946
Relax, I'm taking good care of her.

988
01:16:15,571 --> 01:16:16,781
Come on, come on!

989
01:16:19,409 --> 01:16:22,036
<i>I'm Divina, this is my show.</i>

990
01:16:22,120 --> 01:16:24,205
<i>Until next time, beasties.</i>

991
01:16:28,001 --> 01:16:31,254
He took a shot and he scored. Congrats.

992
01:16:52,984 --> 01:16:54,152
What do you want?

993
01:16:54,235 --> 01:16:56,946
You took my first victory away.

994
01:16:57,572 --> 01:17:00,408
There's no room for an animal like that.

995
01:17:00,491 --> 01:17:02,660
You want a tame little creature?

996
01:17:03,536 --> 01:17:06,706
-I'm through.
-I paid the fucking doctor to save you.

997
01:17:07,582 --> 01:17:10,585
You run for me. Got it?

998
01:17:10,668 --> 01:17:13,463
You have no idea
what it's like outside that room.

999
01:17:13,546 --> 01:17:15,882
While you were drinking your whisky,

1000
01:17:16,549 --> 01:17:20,720
my sister was removing the tracker
from her neck with a blunt knife.

1001
01:17:20,803 --> 01:17:22,764
You have your reasons to run.

1002
01:17:24,182 --> 01:17:25,350
I have mine to play.

1003
01:17:26,476 --> 01:17:29,937
The people in that room need to know
I'm playing and I'm winning.

1004
01:17:30,521 --> 01:17:31,773
You want your sister back?

1005
01:17:32,398 --> 01:17:35,234
Control your hate for the world.

1006
01:17:35,818 --> 01:17:36,986
And play with me.

1007
01:18:06,891 --> 01:18:07,767
Okay?

1008
01:18:10,269 --> 01:18:12,647
How does an animal
become the game manager?

1009
01:18:13,189 --> 01:18:14,023
Good question.

1010
01:18:15,149 --> 01:18:16,734
I'll tell you.

1011
01:18:18,528 --> 01:18:20,863
The best animal in history.

1012
01:18:21,447 --> 01:18:23,574
Winner of the most seasons.

1013
01:18:27,412 --> 01:18:28,413
I know.

1014
01:18:29,872 --> 01:18:30,915
Snake.

1015
01:18:34,544 --> 01:18:35,753
She knew.

1016
01:18:37,130 --> 01:18:38,798
Snake knows how to find a way.

1017
01:18:39,841 --> 01:18:42,051
Right? Look.

1018
01:18:43,344 --> 01:18:44,887
Look where the game can get you.

1019
01:18:46,180 --> 01:18:47,765
Everything is an opportunity.

1020
01:18:48,349 --> 01:18:49,350
Everything.

1021
01:18:51,561 --> 01:18:55,064
Now you get to send whoever you like
to Hell's Coast, right?

1022
01:18:56,482 --> 01:18:59,152
Without having to risk
any of your little women as collateral.

1023
01:18:59,652 --> 01:19:04,782
-What the fuck? Get rid of this brat.
-Stop.

1024
01:19:10,788 --> 01:19:12,623
Hey, Mano.

1025
01:19:12,707 --> 01:19:14,667
Lucky you didn't hunt down anyone here.

1026
01:19:15,418 --> 01:19:17,044
Now you see what it's like.

1027
01:19:17,670 --> 01:19:19,046
There's no way out for us.

1028
01:19:19,630 --> 01:19:21,507
It's the track or the track.

1029
01:19:21,591 --> 01:19:24,760
It's fine to be against it.
Until you need it, right?

1030
01:19:25,928 --> 01:19:29,432
To get Dalva out of this shit,
you need partners on the track.

1031
01:19:31,225 --> 01:19:33,519
I think he gets
that he's the guys' target.

1032
01:19:38,900 --> 01:19:40,943
I'll get you next time, asshole.

1033
01:19:44,489 --> 01:19:49,202
THIRD RACE
SEASON 147

1034
01:19:55,166 --> 01:19:56,209
What's up, Mano?

1035
01:19:57,210 --> 01:19:59,795
Bull's gang is plotting to get you.

1036
01:20:00,588 --> 01:20:04,383
Pig, Horse,
and the brothers, Bull and Bear.

1037
01:20:08,513 --> 01:20:12,225
<i>And another violent race is over.</i>

1038
01:20:14,936 --> 01:20:17,563
<i>The third heat was more violent than ever.</i>

1039
01:20:21,484 --> 01:20:23,194
Watch out for that guy.

1040
01:20:29,700 --> 01:20:32,328
Shake him off. Go on! Shake him. Go!

1041
01:20:57,228 --> 01:21:02,942
<i>And after Bear's fatal fall,</i>
<i>the third heat ends tragically.</i>

1042
01:21:05,111 --> 01:21:06,904
<i>Those who are still alive, go forward.</i>

1043
01:21:06,988 --> 01:21:12,034
<i>Qualified for the final, we have</i>
<i>Bull, Goat, Pig, Tigress and Cat.</i>

1044
01:21:12,577 --> 01:21:15,955
<i>Two of them will take the grand prize</i>
<i>and save their collateral.</i>

1045
01:21:19,208 --> 01:21:20,585
Look who's floating on air!

1046
01:21:21,294 --> 01:21:23,337
The fucking audience!

1047
01:21:23,963 --> 01:21:25,756
Congratulations, gang.

1048
01:21:26,674 --> 01:21:29,510
No need to feel sorry for the dead.

1049
01:21:29,594 --> 01:21:31,762
Feel sorry for us, who are still here.

1050
01:21:35,975 --> 01:21:37,393
I'm sorry about your brother.

1051
01:21:38,227 --> 01:21:39,395
But that's the game.

1052
01:21:52,617 --> 01:21:53,659
Swallow those tears.

1053
01:21:54,910 --> 01:21:57,079
Don't know how to play?
Get off the playground.

1054
01:22:02,293 --> 01:22:03,544
How's Dalva, Abu?

1055
01:22:04,462 --> 01:22:05,921
I need to speak to her.

1056
01:22:14,180 --> 01:22:15,264
He wants to talk to you.

1057
01:22:27,234 --> 01:22:28,152
Dal?

1058
01:22:31,072 --> 01:22:33,240
You are doing well out there.

1059
01:22:34,075 --> 01:22:36,118
I can't wait to have you back.

1060
01:22:36,744 --> 01:22:39,163
<i>Baco and I are really missing you.</i>

1061
01:22:40,623 --> 01:22:42,083
Just one more race--

1062
01:22:42,166 --> 01:22:44,627
He's still got a long way to go.

1063
01:22:45,419 --> 01:22:46,504
<i>But he's fine.</i>

1064
01:22:47,546 --> 01:22:49,256
He knows I'm looking after you.

1065
01:23:18,285 --> 01:23:19,286
What?

1066
01:23:23,499 --> 01:23:24,667
When I met you…

1067
01:23:28,295 --> 01:23:29,505
you were so raw.

1068
01:23:35,386 --> 01:23:36,387
Raw.

1069
01:23:44,186 --> 01:23:45,354
And now…

1070
01:23:48,899 --> 01:23:50,693
you are going in there,

1071
01:23:52,236 --> 01:23:54,280
to fight it out in the final with me.

1072
01:24:16,343 --> 01:24:17,678
A present for you.

1073
01:24:53,798 --> 01:24:55,049
You are in the final.

1074
01:24:59,720 --> 01:25:02,348
Players never meet animals for a beer.

1075
01:25:05,559 --> 01:25:06,811
Why did you call me?

1076
01:25:16,529 --> 01:25:19,114
I understand
you didn't trust me at the beginning.

1077
01:25:26,497 --> 01:25:28,332
I have been in Dalva's place.

1078
01:25:30,543 --> 01:25:32,002
I was my brother's collateral.

1079
01:25:33,754 --> 01:25:35,798
He ran as Pig. He was good.

1080
01:25:37,716 --> 01:25:38,843
He was good.

1081
01:25:40,427 --> 01:25:41,971
But one day, he went out,

1082
01:25:44,515 --> 01:25:45,808
and didn't come back.

1083
01:25:48,185 --> 01:25:50,437
I was 18 when I was lost.

1084
01:25:54,316 --> 01:25:57,319
Thank God I didn't end up on Hell's Coast.

1085
01:25:59,947 --> 01:26:03,158
A guy bought me,

1086
01:26:05,911 --> 01:26:07,162
and now I'm his wife.

1087
01:26:09,748 --> 01:26:11,876
I'm not lost anymore, because of him.

1088
01:26:18,757 --> 01:26:19,758
And your family?

1089
01:26:20,801 --> 01:26:22,428
Leon banned me from seeing them.

1090
01:26:25,055 --> 01:26:27,016
You stop seeing the people you love.

1091
01:26:28,934 --> 01:26:31,061
My brother died.

1092
01:26:34,440 --> 01:26:36,275
I never saw my mom again.

1093
01:26:39,236 --> 01:26:41,030
Why didn't you say anything?

1094
01:26:42,323 --> 01:26:43,866
I never talk about it.

1095
01:26:48,996 --> 01:26:50,623
Looks like rain, right?

1096
01:26:52,625 --> 01:26:53,500
Right?

1097
01:27:07,306 --> 01:27:10,351
-Look at us.
-I didn't see it coming.

1098
01:27:10,434 --> 01:27:12,311
-I said it was going to rain.
-You did?

1099
01:29:04,465 --> 01:29:06,633
<i>Why do you play, after all that?</i>

1100
01:29:06,717 --> 01:29:09,303
I don't want to be
a part of the game forever.

1101
01:29:12,222 --> 01:29:14,141
We can team up against it.

1102
01:29:15,142 --> 01:29:16,310
<i>Finish them.</i>

1103
01:29:17,686 --> 01:29:18,896
<i>You are in there.</i>

1104
01:29:20,689 --> 01:29:21,940
Inside the monster.

1105
01:29:24,068 --> 01:29:26,987
<i>I know. I'm trying, in my way.</i>

1106
01:29:28,363 --> 01:29:31,116
You only kill the monster
if you cut its head off.

1107
01:29:45,589 --> 01:29:46,423
Hey!

1108
01:29:49,802 --> 01:29:52,262
Don't stand on ceremony. Relax.

1109
01:29:53,722 --> 01:29:54,973
Sit down.

1110
01:30:12,199 --> 01:30:16,078
What do you see when you look at me?
In general. What do you see?

1111
01:30:16,578 --> 01:30:18,664
Power? Success?

1112
01:30:19,748 --> 01:30:21,416
I have a soft heart and no one sees it.

1113
01:30:22,751 --> 01:30:25,879
I could have gotten rid of the others
when I met Micaela. But no.

1114
01:30:25,963 --> 01:30:27,005
I look after all three.

1115
01:30:28,173 --> 01:30:29,341
That's who I am.

1116
01:30:29,424 --> 01:30:32,427
I get attached.
I end up taking care of everyone.

1117
01:30:33,262 --> 01:30:37,015
A mom asks me to put her son
on the track, I do.

1118
01:30:37,099 --> 01:30:40,352
I help.
Shit hits the fan, who fixes it? Abu.

1119
01:30:43,105 --> 01:30:44,982
I want to take care of you, Dalva.

1120
01:30:45,065 --> 01:30:46,441
So you won't lack anything.

1121
01:30:53,699 --> 01:30:55,367
You remind me of your mom, Dalva.

1122
01:30:56,493 --> 01:30:57,661
You knew my mom?

1123
01:30:59,746 --> 01:31:00,747
I knew her well.

1124
01:31:01,540 --> 01:31:03,542
-That's why when I saw you--
-When?

1125
01:31:04,376 --> 01:31:05,878
-A long time ago.
-When?

1126
01:31:06,962 --> 01:31:08,380
Before your brother was born.

1127
01:31:11,466 --> 01:31:12,968
But I don't want to pressure you.

1128
01:31:13,886 --> 01:31:15,220
That's enough chatting.

1129
01:31:18,098 --> 01:31:21,560
Let's have some fun.

1130
01:31:22,186 --> 01:31:23,270
Shut up, Abu.

1131
01:31:25,814 --> 01:31:27,024
A present.

1132
01:31:31,486 --> 01:31:32,529
Take it.

1133
01:31:38,785 --> 01:31:39,786
Try it on.

1134
01:31:40,787 --> 01:31:42,122
It will look great on you.

1135
01:31:43,790 --> 01:31:45,459
-Can I go to the bathroom?
-Sure.

1136
01:31:46,585 --> 01:31:47,586
In there.

1137
01:32:02,392 --> 01:32:03,560
Idiot.

1138
01:32:51,066 --> 01:32:52,234
It's perfect.

1139
01:33:09,418 --> 01:33:10,794
That wasn't funny.

1140
01:33:13,964 --> 01:33:15,257
I was trying to be good to you.

1141
01:33:26,727 --> 01:33:28,562
Mano's going to lose.

1142
01:33:28,645 --> 01:33:30,022
You are going to be mine.

1143
01:33:32,774 --> 01:33:33,734
Abu--

1144
01:33:49,750 --> 01:33:52,502
Abu? What happened, love?

1145
01:33:52,586 --> 01:33:56,465
-What's going on?
-It's fine.

1146
01:33:56,548 --> 01:33:59,426
-It's nothing. It's fine.
-My God.

1147
01:34:02,679 --> 01:34:05,682
Come to Daddy.

1148
01:34:36,004 --> 01:34:38,965
I hope you enjoyed your animal.

1149
01:34:41,760 --> 01:34:43,011
It's over.

1150
01:34:44,262 --> 01:34:47,224
Today might be your last day here.

1151
01:34:47,307 --> 01:34:49,351
You should stay here with us.

1152
01:34:50,936 --> 01:34:53,480
-And be the fourth wife?
-Perhaps.

1153
01:34:53,563 --> 01:34:55,399
Abu wants to take care of you.

1154
01:34:56,066 --> 01:34:58,110
I know he can be a bit rude.

1155
01:34:58,193 --> 01:35:03,490
But no man gets to where he is
by playing nice, Dalva.

1156
01:35:04,074 --> 01:35:05,992
And if I become his favorite, Micaela?

1157
01:35:07,035 --> 01:35:08,578
Where does that leave you?

1158
01:35:11,832 --> 01:35:14,543
Take the opportunity, darling.

1159
01:35:15,794 --> 01:35:18,797
It's easy getting used to the good life.

1160
01:35:21,758 --> 01:35:25,679
One day, I want to know
how it works with you guys.

1161
01:35:27,722 --> 01:35:32,269
You sleep beside him all night and
don't take the chance to slit his throat.

1162
01:35:34,020 --> 01:35:36,982
If I were the fourth wife,
I wouldn't miss my chance.

1163
01:35:39,109 --> 01:35:41,278
You think you are clever, right, Dalva?

1164
01:35:42,028 --> 01:35:46,408
You and your game-hating brother
who took meds made from the lost.

1165
01:35:48,577 --> 01:35:51,413
That's called hypocrisy, darling.

1166
01:35:53,665 --> 01:35:54,666
Look here.

1167
01:35:55,167 --> 01:35:59,671
When you are back there, girl,
you will remember me.

1168
01:36:01,423 --> 01:36:03,425
Mano's never going to win that race.

1169
01:36:04,217 --> 01:36:05,760
Abu won't let him.

1170
01:36:12,517 --> 01:36:15,353
Ladies and gentlemen, our finalists.

1171
01:36:20,317 --> 01:36:21,234
Bull.

1172
01:36:22,569 --> 01:36:23,820
Tigress.

1173
01:36:25,238 --> 01:36:26,239
Cat.

1174
01:36:26,990 --> 01:36:29,326
Goat. And Pig.

1175
01:36:30,410 --> 01:36:32,913
Every one of these bodies has a history.

1176
01:36:33,538 --> 01:36:36,583
The history of the game, the race.

1177
01:36:37,375 --> 01:36:43,465
They are here for the pride
of being a part of this spectacle,

1178
01:36:43,548 --> 01:36:47,302
which links the fate
of the rich and poor in this city.

1179
01:36:48,512 --> 01:36:54,100
The unfortunate and the privileged
taking risks on the same game.

1180
01:36:54,184 --> 01:36:56,478
The assholes wait all season for this.

1181
01:36:57,270 --> 01:37:00,232
Get ready for the final!

1182
01:37:03,693 --> 01:37:06,696
FINAL RACE
SEASON 147

1183
01:37:06,780 --> 01:37:09,658
It's the final. It's the end.
It all comes down to this.

1184
01:37:09,741 --> 01:37:14,287
This dry-as-a-bone August's finalists
are ready.

1185
01:37:15,664 --> 01:37:16,957
Bull!

1186
01:37:18,333 --> 01:37:22,170
The world almost ended,
but the game survived.

1187
01:37:26,675 --> 01:37:28,677
-Go!
-Bull!

1188
01:37:28,760 --> 01:37:31,638
<i>Bet wrong</i>
<i>and you will be sobbing all summer.</i>

1189
01:37:33,098 --> 01:37:34,266
I'll take Cat.

1190
01:37:35,100 --> 01:37:37,602
<i>It's been a long road to get here.</i>

1191
01:37:37,686 --> 01:37:41,314
<i>7 kilometers stand between</i>
<i>our five animals and the finish line.</i>

1192
01:37:41,398 --> 01:37:44,067
<i>And this start looks promising.</i>

1193
01:37:48,613 --> 01:37:51,449
<i>Today they start in the city center.</i>

1194
01:37:56,288 --> 01:37:59,499
<i>On this brightly lit track,</i>
<i>victory is the goal.</i>

1195
01:37:59,583 --> 01:38:02,919
But some of these finalists
could take their final fall.

1196
01:38:04,004 --> 01:38:05,672
The stairs will be on your left.

1197
01:38:06,715 --> 01:38:08,508
Today is our day. I can feel it.

1198
01:38:08,592 --> 01:38:11,177
<i>Run to the end, jump.</i>
<i>There's a door on the left.</i>

1199
01:38:11,261 --> 01:38:12,971
I'll wait for you down there.

1200
01:38:13,054 --> 01:38:15,515
You are on the 15th floor
and you will take the stairs.

1201
01:38:16,558 --> 01:38:19,561
Surprised? We are on the 22nd floor.

1202
01:38:20,228 --> 01:38:22,355
<i>We are up the highest.</i>

1203
01:38:23,106 --> 01:38:25,191
<i>If we stay up, we will gain ground.</i>

1204
01:38:25,275 --> 01:38:30,322
<i>Every animal starts at a different point,</i>
<i>and they are up high, close to the sky.</i>

1205
01:38:30,405 --> 01:38:34,075
<i>Might today be Cat's day?</i>
<i>He doesn't seem to be scared of heights.</i>

1206
01:38:34,159 --> 01:38:38,079
<i>But it might be Bull's, Tigress's,</i>
<i>Horse's or Goat's day.</i>

1207
01:38:38,163 --> 01:38:40,874
<i>Only the first two</i>
<i>will save their collateral.</i>

1208
01:38:40,957 --> 01:38:45,920
Time to unleash the beasts!

1209
01:38:51,676 --> 01:38:52,761
<i>Go!</i>

1210
01:38:53,928 --> 01:38:55,764
And the five finalists are off.

1211
01:38:55,847 --> 01:38:58,350
<i>Bull's out in front. He's got one aim.</i>

1212
01:38:58,433 --> 01:38:59,684
<i>Getting down to the floor.</i>

1213
01:39:04,648 --> 01:39:06,650
<i>Goat, Pig, Cat, Tigress,</i>

1214
01:39:06,733 --> 01:39:09,402
<i>are all jumping off precipices,</i>
<i>looking for an exit.</i>

1215
01:39:09,486 --> 01:39:13,073
<i>Whoever reaches the street first</i>
<i>will be out in front.</i>

1216
01:39:24,459 --> 01:39:28,505
<i>If you jump onto the next building,</i>
<i>it will be quicker getting down, okay?</i>

1217
01:39:47,982 --> 01:39:49,609
<i>Bull is hanging over an abyss.</i>

1218
01:39:51,611 --> 01:39:53,863
<i>If I were Tigress,</i>
<i>I would have finished the job.</i>

1219
01:39:53,947 --> 01:39:55,824
<i>An angry Bull is a dangerous one.</i>

1220
01:39:55,907 --> 01:39:58,076
On the second floor, jump.

1221
01:39:58,159 --> 01:39:59,994
<i>And you will overtake Tigress.</i>

1222
01:40:03,373 --> 01:40:06,960
<i>He's a Bull, not a Frog, but he jumped,</i>

1223
01:40:07,043 --> 01:40:10,630
<i>reached the street first,</i>
<i>and Tigress is eating his dust.</i>

1224
01:40:12,507 --> 01:40:15,593
<i>Our fauna have reached</i>
<i>the avenues of the city center.</i>

1225
01:40:15,677 --> 01:40:19,639
<i>Pig's on his own,</i>
<i>but Cat's on his way, and Bull too.</i>

1226
01:40:20,473 --> 01:40:22,684
<i>Things are getting crowded.</i>

1227
01:40:22,767 --> 01:40:26,563
<i>The finalists are bunching up,</i>
<i>studying each other,</i>

1228
01:40:26,646 --> 01:40:28,940
<i>choosing their moment.</i>

1229
01:40:31,192 --> 01:40:32,444
Talk to me.

1230
01:40:32,527 --> 01:40:34,362
They are all bunched up.
They are all good.

1231
01:40:34,446 --> 01:40:36,197
<i>The bikes are wreaking havoc.</i>

1232
01:40:36,281 --> 01:40:39,200
<i>They are there to get in the way,</i>
<i>pile the pressure on, create drama.</i>

1233
01:40:39,284 --> 01:40:41,369
That's what people like. What I like.

1234
01:40:41,453 --> 01:40:43,913
Get out of there. Get away from Bull.

1235
01:40:43,997 --> 01:40:48,293
<i>-Next street, take a left.</i>
-I can't, the bikes are blocking me.

1236
01:40:50,670 --> 01:40:51,504
Go!

1237
01:40:51,588 --> 01:40:53,381
<i>Watch that Cat.</i>

1238
01:40:53,465 --> 01:40:56,676
<i>Those bikes are on top of Cat.</i>

1239
01:41:00,680 --> 01:41:01,973
<i>Great! Head left.</i>

1240
01:41:06,895 --> 01:41:09,314
<i>He's there, almost on top of Goat.</i>

1241
01:41:10,231 --> 01:41:13,818
<i>Tigress comes out of nowhere! Goat down!</i>

1242
01:41:13,902 --> 01:41:15,153
<i>And Cat feels the benefit.</i>

1243
01:41:15,236 --> 01:41:18,740
<i>The bikes are trying to fuck you over.</i>
<i>That's Abu. Be careful.</i>

1244
01:41:27,957 --> 01:41:29,709
Follow him!

1245
01:41:31,377 --> 01:41:32,545
<i>Take Cat out!</i>

1246
01:41:33,630 --> 01:41:34,756
Pig is on your tail.

1247
01:41:35,757 --> 01:41:39,969
<i>Pig is on Bull's tail,</i>
<i>who's always on track.</i>

1248
01:41:41,930 --> 01:41:42,806
Left.

1249
01:41:44,349 --> 01:41:46,351
<i>And we are back in the bottleneck!</i>

1250
01:41:46,434 --> 01:41:50,438
<i>Bull's leading,</i>
<i>this time followed by Pig and Tigress.</i>

1251
01:41:50,522 --> 01:41:53,566
<i>Get rid of the bikes, quickly.</i>
<i>We are falling behind.</i>

1252
01:41:53,650 --> 01:41:55,360
I can't. They are right on me.

1253
01:41:55,443 --> 01:41:58,988
<i>It feels like Cat</i>
<i>is racing the bikes, guys.</i>

1254
01:41:59,072 --> 01:42:00,573
<i>Bike on the right.</i>

1255
01:42:03,618 --> 01:42:05,745
-Nice!
<i>-Smooth!</i>

1256
01:42:05,829 --> 01:42:07,664
<i>He shook the bikes.</i>

1257
01:42:07,747 --> 01:42:10,458
<i>I never saw an animal</i>
<i>putting on this kind of a show.</i>

1258
01:42:10,542 --> 01:42:11,709
The fans love it.

1259
01:42:16,631 --> 01:42:18,383
<i>Speed up. We are well behind.</i>

1260
01:42:18,466 --> 01:42:19,884
Find a route.

1261
01:42:19,968 --> 01:42:23,137
<i>But this final</i>
<i>is going badly for the feline.</i>

1262
01:42:23,221 --> 01:42:26,224
{\an8}<i>He lost a lot of time on that detour.</i>

1263
01:42:27,183 --> 01:42:30,603
<i>Bull tries to pull away</i>
<i>but there are animals on him.</i>

1264
01:42:30,687 --> 01:42:32,564
<i>Pig is in the gap.</i>

1265
01:42:36,943 --> 01:42:39,529
<i>Look at the Goat! He's back.</i>

1266
01:42:39,612 --> 01:42:42,740
<i>He's taken Tigress's place.</i>
<i>She's in trouble.</i>

1267
01:42:43,491 --> 01:42:48,705
<i>We have finally got eyes on Cat.</i>
<i>He had disappeared for a minute there.</i>

1268
01:42:54,752 --> 01:42:56,421
Come on, Tigress! Come on!

1269
01:42:56,504 --> 01:42:58,965
<i>Don't stop, don't stop.</i>

1270
01:42:59,048 --> 01:43:01,718
Don't stop. That time will cost you.

1271
01:43:01,801 --> 01:43:03,219
Bull's out of control.

1272
01:43:03,303 --> 01:43:05,096
I know what I'm doing.

1273
01:43:05,680 --> 01:43:08,725
<i>Helping Tigress at this point</i>
<i>in the competition?</i>

1274
01:43:08,808 --> 01:43:11,185
<i>That's asking for defeat.</i>

1275
01:43:11,269 --> 01:43:14,898
<i>It's practically impossible</i>
<i>for Cat to take this one, my friends.</i>

1276
01:43:15,607 --> 01:43:17,609
<i>I think it's over for these two.</i>

1277
01:43:17,692 --> 01:43:20,945
<i>They can say goodbye</i>
<i>to their collateral and the prize.</i>

1278
01:43:22,697 --> 01:43:25,283
I'm going in. It's our only chance.

1279
01:43:28,411 --> 01:43:29,621
Perimeter.

1280
01:43:29,704 --> 01:43:33,041
<i>Is this animal going to do</i>
<i>what I think he's going to do?</i>

1281
01:43:33,124 --> 01:43:36,878
<i>Didn't he see what happened to Lion?</i>
<i>He went in and never came out.</i>

1282
01:43:37,629 --> 01:43:40,423
<i>Cat's crazy. He will do anything to win.</i>

1283
01:43:40,506 --> 01:43:42,967
He's trying his luck
in the Perimeter of Death.

1284
01:43:46,930 --> 01:43:48,848
<i>Better stay high.</i>
<i>They're watching the streets.</i>

1285
01:43:53,436 --> 01:43:55,146
Sinatra, look at this.

1286
01:43:58,483 --> 01:43:59,567
Look.

1287
01:44:06,324 --> 01:44:07,784
Let's hunt him down.

1288
01:44:09,619 --> 01:44:12,246
The Cat's on the wall.

1289
01:44:13,998 --> 01:44:14,999
That's it.

1290
01:44:19,671 --> 01:44:23,299
<i>Jump over that slab in front of you</i>
<i>and head down.</i>

1291
01:44:27,261 --> 01:44:30,390
<i>I can't see you. Get out of there.</i>

1292
01:44:30,473 --> 01:44:31,849
I know a shortcut.

1293
01:44:34,519 --> 01:44:35,937
Fucking traitor!

1294
01:44:36,437 --> 01:44:38,147
-It's over, brother.
-Take that!

1295
01:44:41,067 --> 01:44:42,318
-Son of a bitch.
-Take that!

1296
01:44:42,402 --> 01:44:43,528
Fucking traitor.

1297
01:44:50,159 --> 01:44:51,077
Go, go!

1298
01:44:57,333 --> 01:45:00,128
-Let's go, Mano!
-Come on, Tigress!

1299
01:45:03,006 --> 01:45:04,716
<i>They are back!</i>

1300
01:45:04,799 --> 01:45:07,844
<i>Cat and Tigress have left the Perimeter.</i>

1301
01:45:07,927 --> 01:45:09,262
How did he get back in the game?

1302
01:45:09,345 --> 01:45:11,597
<i>Amazing!</i>

1303
01:45:11,681 --> 01:45:13,850
<i>You will see them coming</i>
<i>out of the tunnel.</i>

1304
01:45:15,476 --> 01:45:19,564
<i>The three who circled the Perimeter</i>
<i>are emerging from the tunnel.</i>

1305
01:45:19,647 --> 01:45:22,608
<i>Now it's time for the sprint finish.</i>

1306
01:45:22,692 --> 01:45:25,820
They are closing in on the finish line.
What a final, guys!

1307
01:45:26,612 --> 01:45:27,655
<i>Jump down onto the track.</i>

1308
01:45:31,075 --> 01:45:34,662
<i>Cat's in the mix, moving up the ranking.</i>

1309
01:45:34,746 --> 01:45:37,415
<i>What a race!</i>

1310
01:45:38,666 --> 01:45:39,751
Go.

1311
01:45:42,378 --> 01:45:45,298
<i>I have never seen a Bull with a taste</i>
<i>for barbecued Cat before,</i>

1312
01:45:45,381 --> 01:45:47,508
<i>but today, we have got just that.</i>

1313
01:45:47,592 --> 01:45:49,052
<i>Look at them.</i>

1314
01:45:49,677 --> 01:45:52,305
-Bull, Bull, Bull!
<i>-What a final, guys!</i>

1315
01:45:59,479 --> 01:46:03,608
<i>And they are facing off</i>
<i>on the homestretch for the last time.</i>

1316
01:46:03,691 --> 01:46:07,236
<i>This is familiar ground for Bull.</i>
<i>He's looking to play a final card.</i>

1317
01:46:07,320 --> 01:46:08,905
Go, go, go!

1318
01:46:16,746 --> 01:46:19,624
Bull is strong, but he's predictable.

1319
01:46:21,375 --> 01:46:24,462
He's going to want to do the same thing
he did to you last time.

1320
01:46:48,111 --> 01:46:49,487
-Go!
-Get up!

1321
01:46:50,488 --> 01:46:51,823
Get up, you bastard!

1322
01:46:51,906 --> 01:46:54,283
<i>Cat takes Bull out,</i>

1323
01:46:54,367 --> 01:46:57,662
<i>and he's eating dust there,</i>
<i>right before the finish line.</i>

1324
01:46:57,745 --> 01:47:00,331
<i>No one can take this one from him.</i>

1325
01:47:03,793 --> 01:47:05,253
{\an8}1ST CAT
TIME 49:58:38

1326
01:47:17,348 --> 01:47:18,474
I won.

1327
01:47:22,019 --> 01:47:24,647
<i>And the feline takes it, gang!</i>

1328
01:47:24,730 --> 01:47:26,858
<i>Cat's first season</i>

1329
01:47:26,941 --> 01:47:29,861
<i>and he's humiliated the rest of the fauna.</i>

1330
01:47:46,544 --> 01:47:51,632
<i>And that's the end of another season</i>
<i>of the city's most sinister game.</i>

1331
01:47:51,716 --> 01:47:53,384
<i>But the machine never stops.</i>

1332
01:47:53,467 --> 01:47:57,346
Season 148 is coming, and I'll be there.

1333
01:47:57,430 --> 01:47:59,307
I'm Divina, guys.

1334
01:47:59,807 --> 01:48:02,226
The voice and face of this thing.

1335
01:48:03,186 --> 01:48:04,729
I'm off, beasties.

1336
01:48:07,607 --> 01:48:10,610
Who would have thought, huh?
Flying along the track.

1337
01:48:12,653 --> 01:48:14,614
Doesn't look like you hate it.

1338
01:48:17,074 --> 01:48:18,075
Go on.

1339
01:48:19,285 --> 01:48:21,329
You fucking won. Go!

1340
01:48:48,022 --> 01:48:49,482
Beginner's luck, Leon.

1341
01:48:50,149 --> 01:48:52,735
This won't damage your reputation.

1342
01:48:52,818 --> 01:48:55,363
I know it was you who put her in the race.

1343
01:48:57,198 --> 01:49:00,409
You are just an animal
with a bit of power. That's all.

1344
01:49:01,953 --> 01:49:03,913
Excuse me, the board is waiting.

1345
01:49:09,335 --> 01:49:10,336
Senator.

1346
01:49:29,855 --> 01:49:30,898
Hi, Cat.

1347
01:49:35,111 --> 01:49:36,612
She's not here yet.

1348
01:49:38,030 --> 01:49:38,906
So?

1349
01:49:40,032 --> 01:49:42,702
The last time she saw you,
you were on the verge of death.

1350
01:49:45,121 --> 01:49:48,207
And now you are the season's champion.

1351
01:49:50,376 --> 01:49:51,752
You didn't give up on me.

1352
01:49:56,340 --> 01:49:57,883
The money I won in there.

1353
01:49:58,926 --> 01:50:01,637
So Dalva doesn't try
being collateral again.

1354
01:50:03,097 --> 01:50:05,433
Thank you. This…

1355
01:50:06,058 --> 01:50:08,519
We will only kill the monster
if we cut his head off.

1356
01:50:14,483 --> 01:50:16,444
And the only way to do that is playing.

1357
01:50:18,821 --> 01:50:20,281
How are you going to do that?

1358
01:50:21,949 --> 01:50:23,075
Alone…

1359
01:50:24,368 --> 01:50:25,494
But with your help…

1360
01:50:59,070 --> 01:51:01,530
I thought you would want to stay there,
living the life.

1361
01:51:02,698 --> 01:51:03,991
Me too.

1362
01:51:09,205 --> 01:51:11,040
Come on, I want to see Dad.

1363
01:51:27,014 --> 01:51:28,349
Don't be sorry, Abu.

1364
01:51:29,141 --> 01:51:30,643
Dalva isn't for you.

1365
01:51:33,729 --> 01:51:35,189
Your son wants to play.

1366
01:51:55,668 --> 01:51:57,294
CAT

1367
01:52:16,814 --> 01:52:19,442
-I missed you.
-Me too.

1368
01:52:20,526 --> 01:52:21,735
Are you okay?

1369
01:52:41,839 --> 01:52:42,840
Right?

1370
01:52:45,634 --> 01:52:47,052
You had a good teacher.

1371
01:52:51,891 --> 01:52:52,892
And now?

1372
01:52:53,726 --> 01:52:54,977
What will it be?

1373
01:53:00,399 --> 01:53:04,528
BEAST RACE